s is a neat way to be able to sort of  track your diet and you can do many  other things than just this sort of  thing and with that i guess i will wrap  things up and give a quick reviews  basically i showed you what i did last  year with some of the food domains some  entity value features the apple some  applications and a link to the blog post  that i did it shows a little more  information there some show some of the  new food data that we've done with  packaged foods international foods and  cooking equipment and also some nutrient  type stuff things that you can do there  in a brief overview and sub-code with  veal tracking type stuff so at that  point I guess I will open it up for  questions thanks  you  [Applause]

